I fixed the flaky test in `api/internal/api/system_test.go`. The sparse file is now `info.Free + 1<<40` (1 TiB over free space) instead of `info.Free + 1`. Free-space drift on a CI runner can no longer let `CreateBackup` succeed.

The test also checks the `os.Create` and `Truncate` errors now. If the filesystem refuses a file that large, the test skips instead of failing.

`go test -run InsufficientDisk` passes locally. I did not run it repeatedly or on CI, so the flake itself is not shown to be gone.

